dfried","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Erkki","key":"jantunenpau","last":"Jantunen","name":"Jantunen, Erkki","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Iosu","key":"gabilondopau","last":"Gabilondo","name":"Gabilondo, Iosu","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikel","key":"viguerapau","last":"Viguera","name":"Viguera, Mikel","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"8","corresponding":null,"first":"Gregor","key":"papapau","last":"Papa","name":"Papa, Gregor","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/00051144.2020.1794192","issn":["00051144","18483380"],"issn_org":["00051144"],"issue":"4","journal":"Automatika","pages":"537-553","publisher":"Taylor & Francis","status":"p","title":"Automatika","volume":"61"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85088286774"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-ae37bda0-9604-43fb-b92d-99573b457806"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Advanced sensor-based maintenance in real-world exemplary cases","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-100594","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"On the eve of the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) coming into effect we, a university laboratory, marked the occasion with an interactive installation called Compliance. Data traces from Compliance were subsequently processed by the lab, here enacted in the form of a play. While much discussion has centered around modern 'black-boxed' processing of data, less attention has been paid to the value of the data itself, and whether it merits use. We draw on dramaturgical methods for both analysis and presentation [15], allowing for readers to imagine staging their own, different, versions of the event. Drawing on the ambiguous ontological status of (yet unexamined) data, we offer a discussion on the value of data, its use and non-use, as well as how to live with this ambivalence, continuously negotiating social contracts about our further conduct with the data.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Gahoonia, Simy Kaur","Ferreira, Pedro","Cohn, Marisa","Henriksen, Line","Kjær, Katrine Meldgaard","Hockenhull, Michael","Cakici, Baki","Blønd, Marie","Douglas-Jones, Rachel","Laursen, Cæcilie Sloth","Zell, Sonja"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384849"],"event":{"acronym":"CHI","title":"ACM Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["GDPR","data non use","dramaturgical methods"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"upon not opening the black box","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85090243080","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384849","identifier":[{"id":"85090243080","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-f39b7fd5-7493-4bf3-a0f8-14dc03ecc282"