, Christian","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"William R.","key":"jefferywilliamrpau","last":"Jeffery","name":"Jeffery, William R.","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Jure","key":"jugovicjurepau","last":"Jugovic","name":"Jugovic, Jure","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Johanna E.","key":"kowalkojohannaepau","last":"Kowalko","name":"Kowalko, Johanna E.","rank":17,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Thomas M.","key":"lilleythomasmpau","last":"Lilley","name":"Lilley, Thomas M.","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Florian","key":"malardflorianpau","last":"Malard","name":"Malard, Florian","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Raoul","key":"manentiraoulpau","last":"Manenti","name":"Manenti, Raoul","rank":20,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Alejandro","key":"martínezalejandropau","last":"Martínez","name":"Martínez, Alejandro","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Melissa B.","key":"meierhofermelissabpau","last":"Meierhofer","name":"Meierhofer, Melissa B.","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Matthew L.","key":"niemillermatthewlpau","last":"Niemiller","name":"Niemiller, Matthew L.","rank":23,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Diana E.","key":"northupdianaepau","last":"Northup","name":"Northup, Diana E.","rank":24,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Thais G.","key":"pellegrinithaisgpau","last":"Pellegrini","name":"Pellegrini, Thais G.","rank":25,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Tanja","key":"pipantanjapau","last":"Pipan","name":"Pipan, Tanja","rank":26,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Meredith","key":"protasmeredithpau","last":"Protas","name":"Protas, Meredith","rank":27,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ana Sofia P. S.","key":"reboleiraanasofiapau","last":"Reboleira","locid":"3840f980-c12c-4d25-bb21-291ea47795c0","name":"Reboleira, Ana Sofia","name_org":"Reboleira, Ana Sofia P. S.","orcid":"0000-0002-4756-7034","rank":28,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Michael P.","key":"venarskymichaelppau","last":"Venarsky","name":"Venarsky, Michael P.","rank":29,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"J. Judson","key":"wynnejjudsonpau","last":"Wynne","name":"Wynne, J. Judson","rank":30,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Maja","key":"zagmajstermajapau","last":"Zagmajster","name":"Zagmajster, Maja","rank":31,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Pedro","key":"cardosopedropau","last":"Cardoso","name":"Cardoso, Pedro","rank":32,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32841483"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/brv.12642","issn":["14647931","1469185X"],"issn_org":["14647931"],"issue":"6","journal":"Biological Reviews","pages":"1855-1872","status":"p","title":"Biological Reviews","volume":"95"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85089781779"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-24f319d5-7bef-4f78-b6c5-7b9178fab489"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Fundamental research questions in subterranean biology","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-415496","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Background: Loop diuretics are used for congestion relief, and dose adaptations are usually a consequence of the clinicians' clinical judgement about the congestive status of the patient. In EPHESUS (Eplerenone in Patients With Systolic Dysfunction After Myocardial Infarction), many patients required diuretics for congestion relief. We thus hypothesized that blinded allocation to eplerenone would lead clinicians to reduce loop diuretics, as a consequence of the improvement in patients' status. Methods: Cox and mixed-effects models were used over a median follow-up of 1.3 years in 6632 patients. Results: A total of 6632 patients were included; at baseline, 3352 (50.5%) did not have diuretics, 2195 (33.1%) had diuretic doses between 1 and 40 mg/day, and 1085 (16.4%) had diuretic doses >40 mg/day. Patients with higher furosemide equivalent doses had a worse clinical status. Both baseline and follow-up incremental loop diuretic doses were associated with worse prognosis. Eplerenone treatment was associated with lower prescribed loop diuretic doses throughout the follow-up; lower doses were observed at 90 days and decreased further at 180 days and beyond. Eplerenone treatment led to a mean furosemide equivalent dose reduction of -2.2 mg/day (-2.9 to -1.6) throughout the follow-up. Eplerenone was effective in reducing morbidity and mortality regardless of the baseline loop diuretic dose used: hazard ratio for the outcome of cardiovascular death or heart failure hospitalization was 0.83 ([95% CI, 0.75-0.92]; P for interaction, 0.54). Conclusions: Eplerenone treatment led to a loop diuretic dose reduction during follow-up without evidence of treatment effect modification by loop diuretics. These findings suggest that eplerenone reduces congestive signs and symptoms, which enables clinicians to reduce loop diuretic doses.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Ferreira, João Pedro","Eschalier, Romain","Duarte, Kevin","Damman, Kevin","Gustafsson, Finn","Schou, Morten","Girerd, Nicolas","Fay, Renaud","Tala, Stéphane","Pitt, Bertram","Zannad, Faiez","Rossignol, Patrick"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-472392"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Cardiomyopathies","Diuretics","Eplerenone","Sodium Potassium Chloride Symporter Inhibitors"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"reduced diuretic dose in patients treated with eplerenone data from the ephesus trial","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-472392","identifier":[{"id":"32354280","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85084880520","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-83ed89cf-cc44-4bdb-8bde-5d6abdcabb7c"],"keyword":["cardiomyopathies","diuretics","eplerenone","sodium potassium chloride symporter inhibitors"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-AF213E5E5C13523BCCDC84D48067CD51"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Internal medicine: Cardiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"João Pedro","key":"ferreirapau","last":"Ferreira","name":"Ferreira, João Pedro","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Romain","key":"eschalierpau","last":"Eschalier","name":"Eschalier, Romain","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kevin","key":"duartepau","last":"Duarte","name":"Duarte, Kevin","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kevin","key":"dammanpau","last":"Damman","name":"Damman, Kevin","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Finn","key":"gustafssonpau","last":"Gustafsson","locid":"6716eef1-891b-4209-a823-e96e765b9433","name":"Gustafsson, Finn","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Morten","key":"schoupau","last":"Schou","locid":"48fa6ec9-1941-4566-b931-14b0cc8cbae3","name":"Schou, Morten","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Nicolas","key":"girerdpau","last":"Girerd","name":"Girerd, Nicolas","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Renaud","key":"faypau","last":"Fay","name":"Fay, Renaud","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Stéphane","key":"talapau","last":"Tala","name":"Tala, Stéphane","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Bertram","key":"pittpau","last":"Pitt","name":"Pitt, Bertram","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Faiez","key":"zannadpau","last":"Zannad","name":"Zannad, Faiez","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Patrick","key":"rossignolpau","last":"Rossignol","name":"Rossignol, Patrick","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32354280"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1161/circheartfailure.119.006597","issn":["19413289","19413297"],"issn_org":["19413289"],"issue":"5","journal":"Circulation: Heart Failure","status":"p","title":"Circulation: Heart Failure","volume":"13"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85084880520"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-83ed89cf-cc44-4bdb-8bde-5d6abdcabb7c"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Reduced Diuretic Dose in Patients Treated with Eplerenone : Data from the EPHESUS Trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-472392","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"This volume constitutes the refereed proceedings of the workshops which complemented the 20th Joint European Conference on Machine Learning and Knowledge Discovery in Databases, ECML PKDD, held in September 2020. Due to the COVID-19 pandemic the conference and workshops were held online. The 43 papers presented in volume were carefully reviewed and selected from numerous submissions. The volume presents the papers that have been accepted for the following workshops: 5th Workshop on Data Science for Social Good, SoGood 2020; Workshop on Parallel, Distributed and Federated Learning, PDFL 2020; Second Workshop on Machine Learning for Cybersecurity, MLCS 2020, 9th International Workshop on New Frontiers in Mining Complex Patterns, NFMCP 2020, Workshop on Data Integration and Applications, DINA 2020, Second Workshop on Evaluation and Experimental Design in Data Mining and Machine Learning, EDML 2020, Second International Workshop on eXplainable Knowledge Discovery in Data Mining, XKDD 2020; 8th International Workshop on News Recommendation and Analytics, INRA 2020.","author_count":30,"contributors":["Koprinska, Irena","Kamp, Michael","Appice, Annalisa","Loglisci, Corrado","Antonie, Luiza","Zimmermann, Albrecht","Guidotti, Riccardo","Özgöbek, Özlem","Ribeiro, Rita P.","Gavaldà, Ricard","Gama, João","Adilova, Linara","Krishnamurthy, Yamuna","Ferreira, Pedro M.","Malerba, Donato","Medeiros, Ibéria","Ceci, Michelangelo","Manco, Giuseppe","Masciari, Elio","Ras, Zbigniew W.","Christen, Peter","Ntoutsi, Eirini","Schubert, Erich","Zimek, Arthur","Monreale, Anna","Biecek, Przemyslaw","Rinzivillo, Salvatore","Kille, Benjamin","Lommatzsch, Andreas","Gulla, Jon Atle"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-580093"],"event":{"end":"2020-09-14","place":"Ghent, be","start":"2020-09-14","title":"Evaluation and Experimental Design in Data Mining and Machine Learning","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"