{"abstract":"Due to the unknown dead-time coefficient, the time-delay system identification turns to be a non-convex optimization problem. This paper investigates the identification of a simple time-delay system, named First-Order-Plus-Dead-Time (FOPDT), by using the Genetic Algorithm (GA) technique. The quality and performance of the GA-based identification are compared with those based on extended Least-Mean-Square (LMS) methods, subject to the consideration of different types of time-delay systems, excitation signals, Signal-to-Noise Ratios, and different evaluation criteria. The obtained results exhibit that the GA technique has a very promising capability in handling this type of non-convex system identification problem.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Yang, Zhenyu","Seested, Glen Thane"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-115971"],"event":{"end":"2013-09-04","place":"Chengdu, cn","start":"2013-09-02","title":"3rd IFAC International Conference on Intelligent Control and Automation Science","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"time delay system identification using genetic algorithm part one precise fopdt model estimation","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/195258974/2013ICONSGA01.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-115971","identifier":[{"id":"84896361528","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-e2c5495c-59cb-44bf-9400-1505b77691e3"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C9A0218A24BB052C07AB5E259FFADBC1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3182/20130902-3-CN-3020.00115","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/195258974/2013ICONSGA01.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science (ENG)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, AAU Energy, Power Electronic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Zhenyu","key":"yangpau","last":"Yang","locid":"e5da4388-fd3c-4714-baae-1fc575079007","name":"Yang, Zhenyu","orcid":"0000-0001-9430-3309","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Glen Thane","key":"seestedpau","last":"Seested","locid":"d3b91e0b-a564-43d2-8b52-8d2020f078b1","name":"Seested, Glen Thane","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Pedro M.","key":"ferreirapedh","last":"Ferreira","name":"Ferreira, Pedro M.","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.3182/20130902-3-cn-3020.00115","edition":"1","isbn":["9783902823458"],"issn":["14746670"],"issue":"1","pages":"561-567","publisher":"Elsevier","series":"IFAC-PapersOnLine","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 3rd IFAC International Conference on Intelligent Control and Automation Science (2013)","volume":"3"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84896361528"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-e2c5495c-59cb-44bf-9400-1505b77691e3"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Time-Delay System Ide